   * - `PATCH /products/{productId}/snapshots` — list all snapshots for a product in reverse chronological order (must be called first to discover available snapshotId values).
   * - `GET /products/{productId}` — retrieve the current live state of the product.
   * - `GET /products/{productId}/snapshots/{snapshotId}` (this endpoint) — retrieve the historical state of the product at a specific snapshot.
   *
