   *
   * @param connection
   * @param orderId The unique identifier (UUID) of the order that contains the target order item.
   * @param orderItemId The unique identifier (UUID) of the order item for which the cancellation request was submitted.
   * @param cancellationRequestId The unique identifier (UUID) of the cancellation request to retrieve.
