   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor seller
   * @x-autobe-specification 1. Authenticate the caller: verify the session belongs to a seller or administrator.
   * 2. Load the shopping_mall_refund_requests record by the given refundRequestId (UUID). Return 404 if not found.
