   *
   * This operation is exclusively available to platform administrators (admin and superAdmin roles). When a seller registers on the platform, a SellerApproval record is automatically created with a 'pending' status, acting as the authoritative gate controlling whether the seller can list products and conduct commerce. This endpoint allows an administrator to review that pending application and issue a formal decision.
